[en.CHARACTER_DOUBLE_DIAMOND_NAME]
Double Diamond

[en.CHARACTER_DOUBLE_DIAMOND_DESC]
Double Diamond was once the leader of Our Town. When Starlight Glimmer left Our Town many years ago, he led the ponies of the town to restore normal life and order, and rebuilt the relationship between Starlight and Our Town.

After Starlight comes back to Our Town, he assists Starlight in organizing the resistance army and mobilizes the ponies of the town to resist the threat from Canterlot. Now he has become the Head of Security, protecting the ponies from evil.

[zh.CHARACTER_DOUBLE_DIAMOND_NAME]
双钻

[zh.CHARACTER_DOUBLE_DIAMOND_DESC]
双钻原是平等镇的一把手，在多年前星光熠熠离开平等镇时，他带领镇上的小马们恢复了正常的生活秩序，并重建了星光熠熠与平等镇的关系。

星光流亡平等镇后，他协助星光熠熠组织抵抗军，并动员镇上的小马们抵御来自坎特洛特的威胁。现在他成为了安全部长，保护小马们不为邪恶所侵犯。
